@startuml
title LightRAG Query Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #3d4a57
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4c5b6b
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f7fbff
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4c5b6b
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #eef5fb
skinparam DefaultFontName Menlo

|Entry|
start
:Entry + Validation
- aquery_llm / aquery_data
- validate query
- empty query returns FAIL_RESPONSE
- route mode to naive or kg_query;

|Context Build|
if (mode == naive?) then (yes)
  :Naive Context Path
- _get_vector_context
- compute chunk token budget
- process_chunks_unified
- optional rerank via
  apply_rerank_if_enabled
- generate references
- build NAIVE_QUERY_CONTEXT + raw_data;
else (no)
  :KG Context Path
- resolve model_func + extract keywords
- Stage 1 _perform_kg_search
- Stage 2 _apply_token_truncation
- Stage 3 _merge_all_chunks
- Stage 4 _build_context_str
- process_chunks_unified
- final chunk rerank bridge
- generate references + user format;
endif

:Return Gates
- no result if context is missing
- return context/prompt when only_need_*
- otherwise continue to answer generation;

|Answer|
if (Need final answer generation?) then (yes)
  :Answer Generation
- build final system prompt
- Apple bypass if needed
- tools path or cache/use_model_func
- restore bypassed words
- strip prompt echoes
- return QueryResult
- query tools: lightrag_query,
  lightrag_answer, grep,
  duckduckgo_search, web_fetch;
  stop
else (no)
  :Return early;
  stop
endif
@enduml